# PHD2 Session Analyzer configuration
#
# Path to PHD2 guide logs. It may be:
#   - A directory containing guide logs.
#   - A single PHD2 guide-log file.
#   - A glob pattern matching one or more guide logs.
#
# If the path resolves to more than one file, the analyzer selects
# the most recently modified log.
phd2.logs.path=C:/Users/YourUser/Documents/PHD2/*GuideLog*.txt